{"id":51758,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51758"},"modified":"2026-09-02T23:19:45","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T22:19:45","slug":"vb-trail-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vb-trail-run\/","title":{"rendered":"VB Trail Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VB Trail Run 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>5.\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vila Baleeira Trail Run 2026 (VB Trail Run)<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no hist\u00f3rico concelho das <strong>Lajes do Pico<\/strong>, na deslumbrante <strong>Ilha do Pico<\/strong>, no arquip\u00e9lago dos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Promovido pelo Gabinete de Desporto da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal das Lajes do Pico<\/strong> com o suporte da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running de Portugal (ATRP)<\/strong>, a prova de 30 km acolhe com distin\u00e7\u00e3o a grande <strong>Final da Ta\u00e7a de Portugal de Trail 2025\/2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Jardim da Baleia (Galeria Municipal)<\/strong>, o evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong> com a prova rainha do <strong>VBT Trail de 30 km (+2.500m D+)<\/strong>, seguindo-se \u00e0s 10:00 o <strong>VBT Trail Sprint de 18 km (+1.100m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto de 10 km (+400m D+)<\/strong> e a caminhada <strong>SLOW VBT de 8 km<\/strong>. Os trilhos conduzem os participantes entre pastagens de altitude, lajedos vulc\u00e2nicos e linhas de \u00e1gua com a imponente Montanha do Pico e o Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico como pano de fundo, terminando num tradicional jantar conv\u00edvio com entrega de trof\u00e9us.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: 